1
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,350
you stop?

2
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,817
I'm out now you Shut it up

3
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:22,020
Dreaming on!

4
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:28,870
Whoa!

5
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,920
Sir Kin'emon!

6
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,260
Sir Denjiro!

7
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,020
Godspeed ahead!

8
00:01:54,580 --> 00:01:55,900
And to you as well!

9
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:26,760
We're out of money! What now? Oops.

10
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,060
Oh, no!

11
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:30,680
What about dinner? Yes!

12
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,260
Here's the plan!

13
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,048
Let's head to town and beg!

14
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:35,360
Please, no.

15
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,675
It must've been hard.

16
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,180
I'm sorry.

17
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,670
King.

18
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,660
Don't stop.

19
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:54,500
We must go on.

20
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,290
Izo?

21
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:06,897
this may be our end are you certain i've

22
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:09,686
missed too many chances
for a meaningful death

23
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:13,440
all right onward

24
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:18,530
Kiku

25
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:52,320
So, I have given you a
choice, samurai of Orochi.

26
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:58,677
you're free to die alongside your
lord if you like but wouldn't you

27
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:03,620
rather conquer the world with me i know
that you samurai are famously loyal

28
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:10,440
and if any of you have the courage
to challenge us you have my respect

29
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:17,397
i speak for all our ninjas
as head of the oniwabanshu

30
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:21,660
i pledge my forces to
you We are 5,000 strong.

31
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:28,640
The samurai, who also number 5,000 in
total, pledge their allegiance as well.

32
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,740
I welcome you.

33
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,100
Our lord is dead.

34
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:42,480
Well, whatever.

35
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,580
That's great, man.

36
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,377
I'm so glad we're not enemies.

37
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:49,257
I didn't want to have to kill you.

38
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:51,100
Here's to a bright future!

39
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:59,060
How dare you call yourself
samurai after that! Not now, boss!

40
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,400
We gotta lay low!

41
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,700
Well, what do you know?

42
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:09,334
That idiot's flunkies couldn't
wait to get a new master.

43
00:05:10,980 --> 00:05:12,840
Nice thinking, Kaido.

44
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:20,800
Ha ha ha ha ha.

45
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:25,940
Our forces are already
coming together nicely.

46
00:05:27,900 --> 00:05:30,760
Let me go! Hey! Ow!

47
00:05:30,980 --> 00:05:32,100
Don't be a jerk!

48
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:35,200
Keep those slippery Straw Hats restrained!

49
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:36,780
Ha ha ha ha!

50
00:05:38,900 --> 00:05:41,660
If you think you've
won, you're dead wrong.

51
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:45,620
As long as Shinobu escapes,
we still have a chance!

52
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,360
Forgive me, Nami.

53
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,540
I'm going ahead.

54
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:52,520
I'll be fine, just save Mamu!

55
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:58,480
Lord Odin knew from the start, taking
down Orochi doesn't change anything!

56
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:04,300
For 20 years, Kaido has been our true
enemy, the only target that matters!

57
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:15,760
There's no Shogun in Wano now.

58
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:21,340
All his samurai, all his ninja,
all his men will serve me.

59
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:26,000
The people in the flower
capital don't know a damn thing.

60
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:31,400
They're dancing the night away in
what'll be their final hours of freedom.

61
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:42,820
Because I'll say one thing, I've
always had my doubts about you.

62
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:46,897
It's hard for me to believe
that you're the son of a man

63
00:06:46,980 --> 00:06:51,000
like Kozuki Odin You're
nothing but a whimpering coward

64
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:54,440
That's not true

65
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:03,880
This execution serves to bring an end
to the land of Wano as you know it

66
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:09,860
I've been thinking back to the day 20
years ago When we met in the burning castle

67
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:15,220
I asked a question you never answered.

68
00:07:20,180 --> 00:07:22,700
Someone help.

69
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:28,640
Now tell me your name, dammit!

70
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,760
Spideless Brat!

71
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:35,690
Father!

72
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:38,720
Somebody help!

73
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:50,637
if you're not the son
of kozuki odin and toki

74
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:53,797
then i'll cancel your
execution immediately and

75
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:58,397
let you walk free you
would have my apologies

76
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:01,860
it would have been a
great mistake on my part

77
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:09,057
But if it wasn't an heir
And you are their son

78
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:14,360
You'll suffer the same fate
as Odin And die by my hand

79
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:24,240
Now brat One last time

80
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:27,240
What is your name?

81
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,737
See how generous the commander could be?

82
00:08:30,820 --> 00:08:31,840
Don't worry, kid.

83
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:33,457
Your dad won't be ashamed of you.

84
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:35,260
He's been dead for years.

85
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:39,080
Come up with a funny name for us, okay?

86
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,600
You got this.

87
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:48,737
No one will look down on you if
you have to lie, Lord Momonosuke.

88
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:50,440
Just please stay alive.

89
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:58,870
What?

90
00:08:58,953 --> 00:08:59,783
Are you serious?

91
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:03,440
That boy is the real Kozuki Momonosuke?

92
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,740
Of course he is!

93
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,181
Hoden's retainers are alive, too!

94
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:10,230
What?!

95
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,680
The enemy!

96
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,580
Get out of my way!

97
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,880
You mean the samurai made it?

98
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:31,660
All of them are alive? Really?

99
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:37,840
So Odin's sacrifice was
worth it. That's great!

100
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:39,380
He did it!

101
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:42,300
Why are we standing around?

102
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:45,600
Let's get out there and rescue Momonosuke!

103
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:48,060
I can't wait!

104
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:51,817
If the Akasai and I are here, then
that means I get to meet them!

105
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:53,076
Put me down, Yamato!

106
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:54,470
Huh?

107
00:09:54,553 --> 00:09:55,420
Wait a sec.

108
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,797
What did you just call me?

109
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,540
Master Yamato, please stop!

110
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:06,417
Master Yamato and Suha and Luffy are
heading to the floor, moving fast!

111
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,937
You mean the performance floor?

112
00:10:08,020 --> 00:10:08,850
Yes, sir!

113
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:11,077
We're closing in to catch them right now!

114
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,180
No, don't bother.

115
00:10:12,460 --> 00:10:13,695
You know Matt's best.

116
00:10:15,540 --> 00:10:17,540
Beating up my men now, are you?

117
00:10:19,900 --> 00:10:20,730
Yamato!

118
00:10:20,813 --> 00:10:22,720
I'm gonna bust you up!

119
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,200
Puss up! Stop!

120
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,780
We can't go this way!

121
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:35,040
It's too scary! Too scary!

122
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,917
This whole mission is scary!

123
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,118
But you heard them!

124
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:39,692
They're gonna kill Momo!

125
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,900
Oh, I know, but look!

126
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:42,980
Those giants!

127
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,680
They'll gobble us up!

128
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:47,468
They'll grind our bones
to make their bread!

129
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,640
We can do this, pal!

130
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:52,697
Even an emperor of the sea
couldn't take us out, right?

131
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:56,900
If Big Mom can't beat General
Franky, then no one can!

132
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,080
I don't care!

133
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,900
They're still too scary!

134
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:02,621
Don't freak out!

135
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:04,580
You're scaring me too!

136
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,600
Take Commander Jumper!

137
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:07,819
What's your order?

138
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,080
Retreat! Retreat!

139
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:21,620
What is your deal?

140
00:11:23,580 --> 00:11:26,260
You're a samurai, huh? So what?

141
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:28,988
Because I'm going to
be king of the pirates!

142
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:33,100
Your father's a great man.

143
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:36,980
Momonosuke, one day you
will rule this land.

144
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:38,533
Then you'll understand.

145
00:11:48,780 --> 00:11:52,040
You want to know the
meaning of your name? Yes!

146
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,140
I want you to be strong,

147
00:11:56,400 --> 00:12:00,106
but more than that you should be
compassionate and broad-minded

148
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:05,730
Momo

149
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:11,480
It's a word that means perilous among men

150
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:15,300
You want my name?

151
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:17,800
It's Kozuki Momonosuke

152
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:25,540
Hear me now Now I shall become
the Shogun of the land of Wano!

153
00:12:33,780 --> 00:12:35,680
Of course you will, my lord!

154
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:39,080
I'm coming, Lord Momonosuke.

155
00:12:39,420 --> 00:12:41,200
I promise I'll save you.

156
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:45,440
It seems the future of
Wano is in good hands.

157
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:47,309
We're almost there, Luffy!

158
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,306
Let me take these things off.

159
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,260
I promise, right? Yes, please.

160
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:59,420
But, uh, just in case, could
you throw them far away?

161
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:02,920
I don't think they'll
explode, but I can't be sure.

162
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,557
What's wrong with this country?

163
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,920
You're nothing but fools!

164
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,640
Father... Mother...

165
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:31,420
I am a disappointment
to you and to myself.

166
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:34,157
All I wanted was to be able to face you

167
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:36,887
with pride when we
reunited in the afterlife.

168
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:40,477
Iori, I wish I could see you again.

169
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:44,060
If even for a moment, I don't want to die!

170
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,900
Curse these tears!

171
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:49,666
Osamu and I should not
cry in front of others!

172
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:51,720
I am ashamed!

173
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:03,600
You took them off!

174
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:12,800
Luffy, it was true!

175
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:17,180
Go to hell, you stupid
ugly cow, gorilla bastard!

176
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:21,480
You really were going to kill me!

177
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:25,600
Where the hell did that
explosion come from?

178
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,760
Somebody figure it out right now!

179
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,820
Well, that settles it.

180
00:14:37,340 --> 00:14:38,897
I've made up my mind.

181
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:41,060
You're not my father anymore!

182
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:46,680
Whatever trouble you're starting,
you better knock it off!

183
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:57,680
Come back, Yamato!

184
00:14:58,120 --> 00:15:00,180
I'll crush you!

185
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:11,340
I'm glad we weren't too late, but
this isn't our fight to start.

186
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:21,980
That honor belongs to somebody
else, and you know who it is.

187
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:34,340
Yaku!

188
00:16:00,180 --> 00:16:01,010
Hey!

189
00:16:31,500 --> 00:16:32,330
Huh?

190
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,760
The Akazaya Samurai!

191
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,720
Where did they come from?

192
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,550
What?

193
00:16:42,633 --> 00:16:43,817
The kings of the minx?

194
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:45,076
They're still alive?

195
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:50,660
They won't lose to a bunch of ghosts!

196
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:57,170
Izo!

197
00:17:00,180 --> 00:17:02,020
Hey, you shit-heads!

198
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:04,980
Stop drinking and come kick some ass!

199
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:07,020
The party is up!

200
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,700
We're under attack!

201
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:13,400
It's you, Kyoshiro!

202
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,270
Kaido!

203
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:22,280
I'll kill you as many times as it takes!

204
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,960
Surrender your name

205
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:32,440
Thee as a child

206
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:38,040
The blades you wield are
powerless They can't cut me

207
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,720
Stake your very lives on this attack

208
00:17:51,580 --> 00:17:57,980
Odin Leave the land of
water And never return

209
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:13,820
Tsunami

210
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,920
Holden Two-Swords die!

211
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:40,160
Paradise Ports die!

212
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:51,240
I feel it in the old scar Odin gave me.

213
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:53,880
How did the blades pierce my flesh?

214
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:55,540
Why does it burn?

215
00:18:57,380 --> 00:19:01,000
You have underestimated my samurai, Kaido.

216
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:03,840
They can call me a hero or a fool.

217
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:08,160
They can even forget me if they so please.

218
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:09,670
But...

219
00:19:14,020 --> 00:19:18,040
No matter what, my spirit will live on!

220
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:28,520
This shouldn't be possible.

221
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:31,320
Are they using Ryu like Odin did?

222
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:37,360
Pierce him through!

223
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:09,440
It's really them, the Akazai
Samorais. Yeah, I know.

224
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:10,560
Cool, huh?

225
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:14,300
This is my second bloody party in a row.

226
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:16,957
You're not dead down
there, are you, Kaido?

227
00:20:17,040 --> 00:20:18,880
Now get in there!

228
00:20:19,100 --> 00:20:21,500
Slaughter those Akazara rats!

229
00:20:24,140 --> 00:20:26,800
So Straw Hat and the
others were just decoys.

230
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:29,637
They were coven for the
samurai surprise attack.

231
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,308
Keep your eyes peeled, men.

232
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:34,940
If those samurai snuck in,
there might be more intruders.

233
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:36,800
You bet there are!

234
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:47,870
Yeah.

235
00:21:10,600 --> 00:21:12,720
Listen, you spineless thugs.

236
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:15,686
I won't let you lay a
finger on those samurai.

237
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:18,520
Come on, let's get in there and fight!

238
00:21:18,760 --> 00:21:20,701
I could go for some payback, too!

239
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:23,080
I found you, Yamato!

240
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,480
Now get rid!

241
00:21:28,180 --> 00:21:29,010
Headbutt!

242
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:33,280
O .T.

243
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:42,097
How dare you clobber me with that club!

244
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:45,437
I am supposed to be
your ally and now you're

245
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:48,320
running around and playing
hero with Straw Hat.

246
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:50,460
That's ever ever so messed up

247
00:21:51,300 --> 00:21:53,317
There's nothing messed up about it,

248
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:58,460
but this is the day that I
will become Kozuki Oden Huh?

249
00:21:58,940 --> 00:22:00,780
You totally lost me.

250
00:22:00,940 --> 00:22:02,352
Ah, you're such an idiot

251
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:07,557
Master Yamato we need
your help the commander

252
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:10,237
just got attacked by the
Akazaya samurai All right,

253
00:22:10,320 --> 00:22:12,457
we've got invaders running
all over the place.

254
00:22:12,540 --> 00:22:14,897
Whatever you're doing now is not the time.

255
00:22:14,980 --> 00:22:15,810
I disagree.

256
00:22:15,940 --> 00:22:17,277
I'm not your ally anymore.

257
00:22:17,360 --> 00:22:18,840
I am your enemy, in fact.

258
00:22:19,060 --> 00:22:21,800
And I don't care if my father dies. What?

259
00:22:22,560 --> 00:22:24,540
More chaos, I see.

260
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:27,480
Never a dull moment at this party, huh?

261
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:29,120
Come, go!

262
00:22:31,580 --> 00:22:32,920
Alpha, I die!

263
00:22:36,300 --> 00:22:37,620
Wait a minute.

264
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:52,540
That's not good.

265
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:54,200
Did she notice Luffy?

266
00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:07,240
I can't deal with Big Mom!

